CortenDesk
==========

A self-hosted web console for RustDesk servers (hbbs/hbbr), built on
Laravel + Livewire. Devices, users, groups, address books, audit logs,
and a fully native in-browser client (view, control, and file transfer
over the RustDesk protocol — no WASM port, all TypeScript).

Requirements
------------
- PHP 8.4+, Composer, MySQL (or SQLite)
- A RustDesk server (open-source hbbs/hbbr) with WebSocket access
  (wss proxy for ports 21118/21119)

Setup
-----
  composer install
  cp .env.example .env && php artisan key:generate
  php artisan migrate --seed
  php artisan serve

Sign in and set your ID server, relay server, and public key under
Settings. Point RustDesk clients at this console as their API server.

The in-browser client is prebuilt in public/rdclient/. To rebuild it:
  cd webclient && npm install && npm run build

